  test-shell-utils:
    description: |
      test-shell-utils.ts: test-only helpers for running the shell hooks as Claude Code does on each OS. BASH / SH
      are Git Bash on Windows (PARADIGM_TEST_BASH overrides C:\Program Files\Git\bin\bash.exe), bash / sh
      elsewhere; SYS_PATH is the tools-only PATH (POSIX /usr/bin:/bin; Windows Git usr\bin + cmd + System32);
      baseEnv() carries SystemRoot/ComSpec/PATHEXT that Windows children need; shellPath / msysPath embed paths in
      scripts; realPath / tempDir avoid 8.3 names; nodeOnlyDir puts only node on PATH (symlink, or a Git Bash
      wrapper on Windows); SHELL_TEST_TIMEOUT is longer on Windows. Not imported by shipped code.
    file: test-shell-utils.ts
    type: utility
    tags: [test, windows]
